  "description": "<p>Deze originele Nintendo Switch Joy-Con (rechts) is een losse controller die perfect geschikt is als vervanging of uitbreiding voor je bestaande set. Ideaal voor multiplayer games of wanneer je huidige Joy-Con defect of kwijt is.</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"b1a79014-3ccc-41b4-8cd7-5c0dc4c39af1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"430\">Deze Joy-Con verkeert in <strong data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"316\">In Nette Staat</strong> en is technisch volledig functioneel. Normale gebruikssporen kunnen zichtbaar zijn, zonder invloed op de werking.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"463\">Korte productbeschrijving</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"590\">Een originele rechter Joy-Con controller voor de Nintendo Switch, geschikt voor zowel handheld als losse multiplayer gameplay.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"603\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"622\">In Nette Staat</strong> – Normale gebruikssporen mogelijk, 100% functioneel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"692\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<li data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"729\">\r\n<p data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"729\">🎮 Originele Nintendo controller</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"780\">\r\n<p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"780\">🕹️ Perfect als vervanging of extra controller</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"811\">📡 Draadloos via Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"871\">🔄 Te gebruiken los of in combinatie met andere Joy-Con</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"922\">🎯 Geschikt voor alle Nintendo Switch modellen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"944\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\n<li data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<p data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"982\">Type: Controller (Joy-Con Rechts)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1012\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1042\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1042\">Connectiviteit: Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1058\">Kleur: Rood</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1084\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1104\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1146\">Nintendo Switch Joy-Con Rechts (Rood)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1164\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1164\">Joy-Con strap</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1190\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1227\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1227\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-light my-2 flex gap-10 border-t pt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden h-12 w-12 rounded-lg\"> </div>\r\n</div>",
